title: "Philadelphia School District Transit Accessibility Analysis"
authors:
  - family-names: "McCloud"
    given-names: "Amir"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-11
type: software
abstract: >
  A geospatial data analytics project examining changes in
  public school accessibility under the Philadelphia School
  District Facilities Master Plan. The project uses Census
  American Community Survey data, GTFS transit data,
  OpenStreetMap, network analysis, and statistical modeling
  to evaluate geographic equity in school accessibility.
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/AmirLMcCloud/sdp-transit-accessibility"
keywords:
  - Philadelphia
  - Education Policy
  - Transit Accessibility
  - Geographic Information Systems
  - Spatial Analysis
  - Equity Analysis
  - Python
  - Public Policy
